{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Course",
  "name": "The Agentic Enterprise: Operations, People and Innovation",
  "courseCode": "S3",
  "description": "Take agents beyond finance into the rest of the enterprise. Run a three-way match in accounts payable, design an onboarding agent that knows which steps are not its to take, write a contract of success with a baseline, a target and acceptance criteria before any work starts, orchestrate agents across departments, and test a new venture inside the firm with a falsifiable hypothesis. Each module ends in a graded task that encodes the operating rule. S1 is the recommended starting point.",
  "url": "https://contexai.pk/courses/s3-agentic-enterprise-operations-people-innovation/",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "EducationalOrganization",
    "name": "ContexAi Academy",
    "sameAs": "https://contexai.org"
  },
  "educationalLevel": "Intermediate",
  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to apply a three-way match with a price tolerance to decide whether a supplier invoice may be paid.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why exceptions go to a queue for a person rather than being resolved by the agent.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to classify onboarding tasks as agent work, agent work with approval, or human-only work.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to justify the least-privilege principle when an agent requests system access for a new hire.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to evaluate whether a contract of success states a measurable baseline, target and acceptance criteria.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to calculate how much of the promised improvement a deployment has delivered.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why every step in a cross-departmental agent workflow needs a single named owner.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to apply a pre-registered decision rule to judge an internal venture experiment as pivot, persevere or inconclusive."
  ],
  "timeRequired": "PT11H",
  "inLanguage": "en",
